{
  "title": "Cloud Job Market 2026 - Postings & Salaries",
  "id": "johnmehler/cloudjobs-cloud-job-market",
  "isPrivate": false,
  "subtitle": "11k live cloud/DevOps job postings with normalized USD salaries, monthly snapshots",
  "description": "Open datasets on the cloud computing job market, aggregated from CloudJobs (https://cloudjobs.io) - a live job board tracking cloud, DevOps, SRE, and platform-engineering roles across AWS, Azure, GCP, Kubernetes, and adjacent stacks.\n\nDatasets included:\n- cloudjobs-market-overview.csv - point-in-time snapshot: total jobs, companies, median/avg salary, remote split\n- cloudjobs-certifications.csv - job count and average salary per certification (AWS, Azure, GCP, Kubernetes, CompTIA, CISSP)\n- cloudjobs-technologies.csv - job count and average salary per technology\n- cloudjobs-companies.csv - per-company role counts, remote/hybrid/onsite mix, salary min/median/max\n- cloudjobs-locations.csv - role counts and average salary by location\n- cloudjobs-jobs.csv - full live postings feed: title, company, location, remote flag, salary range, technologies, certifications, posted date, canonical URL\n\nThis is a point-in-time monthly snapshot (version history on Kaggle; immutable releases on GitHub). The live, always-current feed is at https://cloudjobs.io/datasets and releases are at https://github.com/johnmehler/cloudjobs-datasets/releases.\n\nMethodology: https://cloudjobs.io/methodology",
  "licenses": [
    {
      "name": "Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)"
    }
  ],
  "expectedUpdateFrequency": "monthly",
  "userSpecifiedSources": "Aggregated from live job postings collected from applicant tracking systems and employer boards by CloudJobs (https://cloudjobs.io). Methodology: https://cloudjobs.io/methodology. Live feed: https://cloudjobs.io/datasets.",
  "image": "cover.png",
  "collaborators": [],
